You can't apply a unihorn while paralyzed, what with being paralyzed and
all. Free action prevents this; as getting paralyzed on the planes is
usually an instadeath, this is considered a good thing.

However, assuming a standard Ascension Kit, there is exactly one way to
get paralyzed: a mob throwing a potion of paralysis at you. This is
fairly rare, but there is no other way to defend against it.

Your choice.

